<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aukland plans 71.6 mln rand rights issue.</title>
<headline>Aukland plans 71.6 mln rand rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auckland Investments said on Wednesday it planned to raise some 71.6 million rand via a rights issue of which Peter Vundla's Pamodzi Consortium will underwrite around 46.5 million.</p>
<p>The issue will facilitate the investment of Pamodzi and the proceeds will be used to fund further acquisitions in the healthcare area and reduce borrowings, where appropriate.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
